    <values>
        <field>AIInstructions__c</field>
        <value xsi:type="xsd:string">The reference is the org chart's list of ownership relationships (OwnerName, OwnedEntityName, OwnershipPercent). PASS when the source (the dealer account name) appears as an OwnedEntityName in the list, i.e. the chart shows who owns this dealer. Ignore case, punctuation, entity-suffix variants (LLC / L.L.C., Inc / Incorporated) and a bracketed label at the end of the source (e.g. "(E2E)", "(Demo)"). FAIL when no OwnedEntityName matches. CANNOT_DECIDE when the ownership list is unreadable.</value>
